#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SE2307 expect=skipped domain=FW
#note "THE §4 GATE PIN (top-level-or board wave 2, group J): FWDY is not present as a column; the pre-split bare empty(--DY) leaf flooded on every row here. The parent now carries Requirements.Variables.All [--DY] - an auditable SKIP naming the column. FWENDY is present with a missing value on row 2 - that is the split sibling FDA-SE2307-A's state, reported there and never here. If this EXECUTES, the gate has been removed - escalate, do not rewrite."
#library standard=sendig version=3-1-1
dataset FW class=FINDINGS label="Food and Water Consumption"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID  type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col FWSEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col FWTESTCD type=Char label="Food/Water Consumption Short Name"
col FWENDY   type=Num  label="Study Day of End of Observation"
---
S1 | FW | 001 | 1 | FCONSUM | 8
S1 | FW | 001 | 2 | FCONSUM | .
